    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed with Unreal Engine and powered by state-of-the-art rendering technologies, REDACT delivers a gritty, immersive tactical shooter experience that blurs the line between video games and reality \u2014 giving players the most authentic and realistic experience possible.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816490/extras/8e64f82eff258407feec158149ab94d9.poster.avif?t=1755599589\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816490/extras/8e64f82eff258407feec158149ab94d9.webm?t=1755599589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816490/extras/8e64f82eff258407feec158149ab94d9.mp4?t=1755599589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REDACT is a hyper-realistic bodycam first-person shooter where players take on the role of an elite operator completing high-risk tactical missions. With immersive audio, limited HUD, realistic gunplay, and a grounded single-player and multiplayer experience, the game challenges players to use real-world tactics, make split-second decisions, and survive intense urban combat scenarios.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816490/extras/c474b26e3b98a4e04e47f730dbe1c91e.poster.avif?t=1755599589\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816490/extras/c474b26e3b98a4e04e47f730dbe1c91e.webm?t=1755599589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816490/extras/c474b26e3b98a4e04e47f730dbe1c91e.mp4?t=1755599589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>CORE FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free-Aiming System with No Crosshair</strong><br>Master a raw aiming system that offers no aim assist, no crosshair \u2014 just your skill, your weapon, and pure focus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist and Tactical Gunplay</strong><br>No arcade chaos \u2014 every bullet counts. Execute your plans with caution in a \u201cdie and retry\u201d structure that punishes carelessness and rewards precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Player and Multiplayer Missions</strong><br>Play intense solo operations or join forces in cooperative tactical missions where coordination is key and failure is unforgiving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bodycam-Style Immersion</strong><br>Experience the game through a body-mounted camera with realistic head and weapon movement, aggressive motion effects, and zero UI distractions \u2014 as close to real footage as it gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built in Unreal Engine Using Modern Tech</strong><br>Designed with the latest features of Unreal Engine to deliver photorealistic visuals, immersive audio, and responsive gameplay for the most grounded experience possible.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed with Unreal Engine and powered by state-of-the-art rendering technologies, REDACT delivers a gritty, immersive tactical shooter experience that blurs the line between video games and reality \u2014 giving players the most authentic and realistic experience possible.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816490/extras/8e64f82eff258407feec158149ab94d9.poster.avif?t=1755599589\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816490/extras/8e64f82eff258407feec158149ab94d9.webm?t=1755599589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816490/extras/8e64f82eff258407feec158149ab94d9.mp4?t=1755599589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REDACT is a hyper-realistic bodycam first-person shooter where players take on the role of an elite operator completing high-risk tactical missions. With immersive audio, limited HUD, realistic gunplay, and a grounded single-player and multiplayer experience, the game challenges players to use real-world tactics, make split-second decisions, and survive intense urban combat scenarios.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816490/extras/c474b26e3b98a4e04e47f730dbe1c91e.poster.avif?t=1755599589\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816490/extras/c474b26e3b98a4e04e47f730dbe1c91e.webm?t=1755599589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816490/extras/c474b26e3b98a4e04e47f730dbe1c91e.mp4?t=1755599589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>CORE FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free-Aiming System with No Crosshair</strong><br>Master a raw aiming system that offers no aim assist, no crosshair \u2014 just your skill, your weapon, and pure focus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist and Tactical Gunplay</strong><br>No arcade chaos \u2014 every bullet counts. Execute your plans with caution in a \u201cdie and retry\u201d structure that punishes carelessness and rewards precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Player and Multiplayer Missions</strong><br>Play intense solo operations or join forces in cooperative tactical missions where coordination is key and failure is unforgiving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bodycam-Style Immersion</strong><br>Experience the game through a body-mounted camera with realistic head and weapon movement, aggressive motion effects, and zero UI distractions \u2014 as close to real footage as it gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built in Unreal Engine Using Modern Tech</strong><br>Designed with the latest features of Unreal Engine to deliver photorealistic visuals, immersive audio, and responsive gameplay for the most grounded experience possible.</p>",
    "short_description": "REDACT is a realistic bodycam first-person shooter where you complete tactical missions using real-world strategies, limited resources, and immersive audio in both single-player and multiplayer modes.",
